# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/

# Generated by Tauri
# will have schema files for capabilities auto-completion
/gen/schemas

# The voice engine dylib — compiled from macos/transcriber/AminVoice.swift
# by .github/workflows/build-macos.yml on a macOS CI runner and placed here
# so tauri.conf.json's bundle.resources can pick it up. Never a source
# file; never commit a compiled binary.
/libaminvoice.dylib

# A CI-time copy of macos/transcriber/Resources/ECAPA_TDNN.mlpackage (the
# real, committed source) — copied here instead of referenced via a "../"
# bundle.resources path, which real-world evidence (2026-08-28: Mona's Mac
# failed to dlopen libaminvoice.dylib entirely on the release that first
# added the "../" resource entry) suggests broke resource bundling for the
# whole app, not just this one file. Same pattern as libaminvoice.dylib
# above: a build-time copy, never a source file.
/ECAPA_TDNN.mlpackage
